1
00:00:00,402 --> 00:00:03,862
Ahh, I cannot believe you guys
aren't gonna play with these.

2
00:00:04,072 --> 00:00:05,992
We told you, you don't. It's mint-in-box.

3
00:00:06,199 --> 00:00:08,119
l don't know. I just think it's a waste.

4
00:00:13,707 --> 00:00:16,247
Just relax, I'm just looking at the box.

5
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:21,130
(Sheldon:)You should look with your eyes and not
your muscular Nebraska man-hands.

6
00:00:22,424 --> 00:00:24,254
(Penny:)What is your problem?

7
00:00:24,468 --> 00:00:27,388
(Sheldon:)My problem is that I don't want you
to break Leonard's toy...

8
00:00:27,596 --> 00:00:31,726
(Sheldon:)...which you probably did by shaking it.
She shook it, we all saw her.

9
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:35,727
(Penny:)Leonard, I bought you this
because I wanted you to have fun with it.

10
00:00:35,937 --> 00:00:38,187
l didn't want it to sit in this box.

11
00:00:38,398 --> 00:00:40,108
You know what? You're right.

12
00:00:40,776 --> 00:00:43,616
l mean, it's from you.
I'm never gonna sell it.

13
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:44,860
(Leonard:)- I'm opening it.
- Yes.

14
00:00:57,292 --> 00:00:59,022
(Sheldon:)- It's broken.
- What?

